# android/ci/debug.keystore is committed ON PURPOSE: the APK is sideloaded, and every
# build must be signed with the same key or Android refuses to update the installed app
# (losing this key in v1.2.1 forced a reinstall). It's a debug key; see android/README.md.
android/dist/*.idsig
